# The Python bare-directory rules above (notably "lib/") otherwise match
# frontend source folders named "lib". Re-include them so real source and
# tests are tracked (e.g. frontend/lib/{utils,sanitize}.ts and the lib tests).
!frontend/lib/
!frontend/__tests__/lib/
